<XML ID="EQInterfaceDefinitionLanguage">
	<Schema xmlns="EverQuestData" xmlns:dt="EverQuestDataTypes" />
	<!-- ============================================================
	     Modernized spell book, "clean list" layout (modern full-window theme)
	     - slate window with a header; each page is a column of 8 rows: icon, name, and a
	       dot at the right (blue = beneficial, red = detrimental). The game picks
	       BDT_BlueBuff / BDT_RedBuff per spell, so the row art carries that colour.
	     - every spell is one full-width row button, drawn above its name, so the whole
	       row highlights gold on hover and takes clicks (the row art is see-through
	       where the name sits)
	     - names in one line, soft white; zebra striping on alternate rows
	     - "PAGE" captions with the game's page numbers beside them, in gold
	     - footer: page arrows at each corner (dim when there's no page to turn to) and
	       the memorize / scribe bar centred between them
	     Art: wnd_pieces.dds (EQUI_Animations.xml); tile templates in EQUI_Templates.xml
	     ============================================================ -->
